From 87018a421f5be1064767d2cdd32e75ca935f7cdb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bradley Gleave <bradley@bradleytgpcoaching.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 05:19:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] S8-C: honour failed target verification, enum_unmapped, child
 provenance namespace

Return a failed verifyTarget outcome (native_target_removed or
identity_conflict) from persistEvidence before any evidence or provenance
write, so a CREATED provenance row is never rewritten. Emit
enum_unmapped:<field> for an enum key absent from the explicit map, keeping
invalid_value for bad raw types and destinations. Record exercise children
under entity_type workouts.exercise in both the child key and the
unresolved-children count, so a top-level id equal to an encoded child id
stays a distinct identity. Stage the legacy client_history proof case on
the accepted TrueCoach source.
---
